    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Hi! Welcome to the team!  ( ^_^) /


    We''re so excited to have you
    as our new project manager. We can''t wait to see how you handle our brand new
    game.


    We sent you two more e-mails that will answer any question that you
    have about your mission and duties. As you know, we are AAA game studio that
    will be launching a brand new game soon, as our new project manager we need you
    to direct the game until its release. You will be working with our hard working
    team that is divided on 3 sectors: Interns, game designers, game programmers
    and artists. Our team is an asset that will help us reach our goal (More info
    in the second e-mail).


    We are excited to have you here, and again, welcome
    to the team.'
