--- !u!114 &1958120593
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1958120591}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 0.22352941, g: 0.16078432, b: 0.27450982, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: 4b451dec61cd6b745928cc35eb16765f, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 30
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 10
    m_MaxSize: 75
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "As we mentioned on our past e-mail, as a AAA studio, we are launching
    our next game, you need to direct the project until release. Your only job is
    to finish the game, and to do this, our team will help you. \n\nInterns will
    get all the resources that the team need to develop the game, developers, artists
    and designers will take care of problems and issues that the game will generate,
    you just need to guide them. We aren't a 100% sure, but I heard that if you LEFT
    CLICK on structures and workers you will see what they can do. I also heard that
    if you LEFT CLICK a worker and then RIGHT CLICK somewhere you can tell them where
    to go, but we might need to research more about that.\n\nWe also have 3 primary
    resources that make possible the development of the game: code lines, assets
    and (of course) money. This resources are at your disposal, they can be used
    for buying stuff and hire people. If you think that we need more developers for
    the team, let me know at any time, I'm at my desk. "
